<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-21111] sanity-sec test_59a: could not resync mirror</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21111</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name="Problem"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Problem&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;sanity-sec test_59a fails from time to time with SSK. After the remount without the encryption key, &lt;tt&gt;lfs mirror resync&lt;/tt&gt; cannot stat the scrambled file and gets EAGAIN:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;lfs: cannot stat file '/mnt/lustre/d59a.sanity-sec/hiJebtPCy7mFSOtl8oBbTg': Resource temporarily unavailable.
 sanity-sec test_59a: @@@@@@ FAIL: could not resync mirror
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name="Environment"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Environment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;master at 7183418602 ("&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18502" title="YAML export for nodemaps" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-18502"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-18502&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ptlrpc: print enable_cap_mask as a YAML flow mapping").&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;3 VMs, rocky9: 1 MGS and MDS with 1 MDT, 1 OSS with 2 OSTs, 1 client.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;SHARED_KEY=true&lt;/tt&gt;, flavor ski on cli2mdt and cli2ost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name="Reproduction"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Reproduction&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Run &lt;tt&gt;ONLY=59a SHARED_KEY=true bash sanity-sec.sh&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Repeat. The test failed in 4 of 7 runs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name="Analysis"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Analysis&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The failure does not come from the &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21109" title="sanity test_247f: client mount fails with EEXIST: GSS ctx init RPC outlives umount" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-21109"&gt;LU-21109&lt;/a&gt; fix. Without that fix, the test failed in 1 of 3 runs. With that fix, it failed in 3 of 4 runs. The fix changes only ctx init RPCs on a closing import.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The error is always the same. The test remounts the client without the key, and then runs &lt;tt&gt;lfs mirror resync&lt;/tt&gt; at once on the encrypted file. The stat in &lt;tt&gt;lfs&lt;/tt&gt; returns EAGAIN. We have not found which layer returns EAGAIN. We have not checked whether the failure also occurs without SSK.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17372" title="sanity-sec test_59a: mirror verify failed (1)" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-17372"&gt;LU-17372&lt;/a&gt; is a different failure in the same test ("mirror verify failed (1)").&lt;/p&gt;</description>
